{
  "name": "15_9 n8n to LangGraph Bridge",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 15_9 n8n -> LangGraph bridge\n**Setup**\n1. Start the agent: `python 15_9_langgraph_agent_service.py` (port 8015).\n2. Publish 15_3 too - the agent creates tickets through its webhook.\n**Test** (PowerShell):\n`Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post http://localhost:5678/webhook/ask-agent -ContentType application/json -Body '{\"question\":\"My router has been dead since yesterday\",\"name\":\"Asha\",\"email\":\"asha@example.com\"}'`\nn8n runs in Docker, so it reaches your PC as host.docker.internal.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "5e5e7eff-9883-4123-ae97-46695aba7a92",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
